      "title": "Centre releases fortnightly sugar quota for September, prices stay firm",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/industry/agriculture/centre-releases-fortnightly-sugar-quota-for-september-prices-stay-firm-126083000733_1.html",
      "description": "Centre fixes a 1.3 million tonne sugar quota for September 1-15 as retail prices remain above Rs 60 per kg despite government measures to check the rise",
